\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Almighty Father, who dost give,
\par The gift of life to all who live,
\par Look down on all earth's sin and strife,
\par And lift us to a nobler life.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Lift up our hearts, O King of kings,
\par To brighter hopes and kindlier things,
\par To visions of a large good,
\par And holier dreams of brotherhood.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thy world is weary of its pain,
\par Of selfish greed and fruitless gain,
\par Of tarnished honour, falsely strong,
\par And all its ancient deeds of wrong.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Hear Thou the prayer Thy servants pray,
\par Uprising from all lands to- day,
\par And o'er the vanquished powers of sin
\par O bring Thy great salvation in.
\par                               Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

